{"about_the_game":"What would happen if you took an incredibly clever AI made in the 90\u2019s and used it to help you make a puzzle game? You\u2019d get Omi Oh My AI! Go on a captchavating adventure through over 100 image, word, and number puzzles inspired by internet security (and a healthy love of dogs). <br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/extras/Steam_Reflection.gif?t=1740389934\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SELECT THE DOGS</h2>But how could we make a game all about constantly needing to prove you are not a robot and make it into something fun? Omi did that for us! AI do not see the world the way we do, so you will need to learn to see through their eyes. Don\u2019t expect it to be easy!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/extras/Steam_MissingImage.gif?t=1740389934\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NULL REFERENCE EXCEPTION</h2>The bugs and glitches you come across are all just part of Omi\u2019s charm. We\u2019ve tested thoroughly to identify any game-breaking bugs, but be sure to check our website and steam documentation if you come across anything that you are unable to figure out on your own!<br><br><br>Omi Oh My AI was made possible with funding from Screenwest and Lotterywest<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/extras/Screenwest-Co-Badge-CMYK-Lockup_Reverse_Small.png?t=1740389934\" />","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1867110?t=1740389934","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740389934","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740389934","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740389934","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"What would happen if you took an incredibly clever AI made in the 90\u2019s and used it to help you make a puzzle game? You\u2019d get Omi Oh My AI! Go on a captchavating adventure through over 100 image, word, and number puzzles inspired by internet security (and a healthy love of dogs). <br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/extras/Steam_Reflection.gif?t=1740389934\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SELECT THE DOGS</h2>But how could we make a game all about constantly needing to prove you are not a robot and make it into something fun? Omi did that for us! AI do not see the world the way we do, so you will need to learn to see through their eyes. Don\u2019t expect it to be easy!<br><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/extras/Steam_MissingImage.gif?t=1740389934\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">NULL REFERENCE EXCEPTION</h2>The bugs and glitches you come across are all just part of Omi\u2019s charm. We\u2019ve tested thoroughly to identify any game-breaking bugs, but be sure to check our website and steam documentation if you come across anything that you are unable to figure out on your own!<br><br><br>Omi Oh My AI was made possible with funding from Screenwest and Lotterywest<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/extras/Screenwest-Co-Badge-CMYK-Lockup_Reverse_Small.png?t=1740389934\" />","developers":["EverySecond Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1867110/header.jpg?t=1740389934","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":